<title>USA: Total Renal Care sets shr offer at $39.</title>
<headline>Total Renal Care sets shr offer at $39.</headline>
<dateline>TORRANCE, Calif 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total Renal Care Holdings Inc said it had priced its public offering of 2.5 million shares at $39 per share.</p>
<p>The company said net proceeds from the sale will be used for acquisitions, development, working capital and other corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Based in Torrance, Total Renal Care Holdings provides integrated dialysis services for patients suffering from chronic kidney failure.</p>
</text>
